{"id":"9a0e4e3dae0f2467","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-stable-images.md","title":"Pullback-Stable Images","display":"df-stable-images — Pullback-Stable Images","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-stable-images","aliases":["93-df-stable-images"],"display":"df-stable-images — Pullback-Stable Images","depends_on":["[[93-df-finitely-complete-category]]","[[93-df-image]]","[[93-df-pullback]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-stable-images"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-stable-images</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stable-images — Pullback-Stable Images"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fbf91595366c330b\" href=\"?note=fbf91595366c330b\" title=\"93-df-finitely-complete-category\">93-df-finitely-complete-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8311ab8098e68fa0\" href=\"?note=8311ab8098e68fa0\" title=\"93-df-image\">93-df-image</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7702f850d0f755f5\" href=\"?note=7702f850d0f755f5\" title=\"93-df-pullback\">93-df-pullback</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fbf91595366c330b\" href=\"?note=fbf91595366c330b\" title=\"93-df-finitely-complete-category\">93-df-finitely-complete-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> (the object and hom-set projections inherited through <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fbf91595366c330b\" href=\"?note=fbf91595366c330b\" title=\"93-df-finitely-complete-category\">93-df-finitely-complete-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Image}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Image}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}\\)</span> (see their defining atoms)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StableImg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{StableImg}_{93}\\)</span> (the stable-image predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stable\\text{-}images}\\vdash \\mathrm{StableImg}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl[\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\;\n\\exists I,e,m\\;\\mathrm{Image}_{93}(I,e,m,f,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl[\\forall A,B,B&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B&#39;,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall I,e,m,P,p_A,p_{B&#39;},Q,q_I,q_{B&#39;}\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{Image}_{93}(I,e,m,f,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}(P,p_A,p_{B&#39;},f,g,A,B&#39;,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}(Q,q_I,q_{B&#39;},m,g,I,B&#39;,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\exists e&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P,Q)\\;\n\\mathrm{Image}_{93}(Q,e&#39;,q_{B&#39;},p_{B&#39;},P,B&#39;,\\mathcal C)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stable\\text{-}images}\\vdash \\mathrm{StableImg}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl[\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\;\n\\exists I,e,m\\;\\mathrm{Image}_{93}(I,e,m,f,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl[\\forall A,B,B&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B&#39;,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall I,e,m,P,p_A,p_{B&#39;},Q,q_I,q_{B&#39;}\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{Image}_{93}(I,e,m,f,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}(P,p_A,p_{B&#39;},f,g,A,B&#39;,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}(Q,q_I,q_{B&#39;},m,g,I,B&#39;,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\exists e&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P,Q)\\;\n\\mathrm{Image}_{93}(Q,e&#39;,q_{B&#39;},p_{B&#39;},P,B&#39;,\\mathcal C)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The first quantified clause supplies an image for every arrow. The second says that pulling an image mono back along any arrow produces an image of the pulled-back arrow.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-finitely-complete-category","status":"resolved","id":"fbf91595366c330b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-finitely-complete-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-image","status":"resolved","id":"8311ab8098e68fa0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-image]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"7702f850d0f755f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-pullback]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finitely-complete-category","status":"resolved","id":"fbf91595366c330b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}(\\mathcal C)$ (see [[93-df-finitely-complete-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finitely-complete-category","status":"resolved","id":"fbf91595366c330b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}$ and $\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}$ (the object and hom-set projections inherited through [[93-df-finitely-complete-category]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Image}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StableImg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stable\\text{-}images}\\vdash \\mathrm{StableImg}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land\\Bigl[\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\;\n\\exists I,e,m\\;\\mathrm{Image}_{93}(I,e,m,f,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\Bigl[\\forall A,B,B'\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B',B)\\\\\n&\\quad\\forall I,e,m,P,p_A,p_{B'},Q,q_I,q_{B'}\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&\\qquad\\mathrm{Image}_{93}(I,e,m,f,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}(P,p_A,p_{B'},f,g,A,B',B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}(Q,q_I,q_{B'},m,g,I,B',B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\to\\exists e'\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P,Q)\\;\n\\mathrm{Image}_{93}(Q,e',q_{B'},p_{B'},P,B',\\mathcal C)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1810,"backlinks":[{"id":"703de0dbb1e0c2b6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StableImg}_{93}$ (pullback-stable image predicate, see [[93-df-stable-images]])"},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-stable-images]]"}],"outgoing":["fbf91595366c330b","8311ab8098e68fa0","7702f850d0f755f5"]}